      "width": 650,
      "height": 300,
      "data": {
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "event-handler-smoke"
        },
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Event Handler node smoke test\n\n1. Enter edit mode and edit **Demo label**.\n2. Change its value and Apply.\n3. Verify **Update rendered label** reports a successful run.\n4. Verify **Rendered result** changes immediately.\n\nThe graph intentionally contains no Event declaration or Subscription node. The handler is directly bound to the Property’s intrinsic `property.changed` event."
        }
      }
    },
